comment
Groups
* You can easily group tracks and apply parameters to all of them
endcomment

group instruments
pitch 2
    5 * oneshot ppiano/1to10 every 10to15
        volume goto(0and0.2 in .5)
        move x -10to10 y 0to15 z -10to5 speed 2to3
        visual trail
        color red gobetween(0and255 as incubic in 20) green 0to255 blue 0to255

    5 * oneshot tk/10to20 every 10to15
        volume goto(0and0.2 in .5)
        move x -10to10 y 0to15 z -10to5 speed 2to6
        visual trail
        color red gobetween(0and255 as incubic in 8) green gobetween(0and100 as inquad in 10) blue gobetween(0and155 in 15)
endgroup

group beat
volume gobetween(0and0.3 in 10)
color red 255 green 0 blue 0
    4 * loop beat
        randomstart
        volume 0.4
        pitch gobetween(1and2 as inquad in 10)
        move walk speed 4
        visual sphere